Description: Add SwapPss, TPSS, and anon/file/shmem columns
 When the kernel exports them, process listings gain swappss, tpss
 (PSS + SwapPss), pssa/pssf/psss (Pss_Anon/File/Shmem), and
 rssa/rssf/rsss (RssAnon/File/Shmem from /proc/<pid>/status).
 The mapping report gains avgvss, swappss, and tpss. Percentages for
 SwapPss use SwapTotal. Missing metrics produce a warning.
Origin: https://github.com/G-dH/smem
Forwarded: no
Author: Hualet Wang <mr.asianwang@gmail.com>

